{"about_the_game":"Welcome to the <strong>League of Speedrunners</strong>! It's a third-person 3D platformer that takes you to a magical world. The familiar civilization, with its modern technologies, sank to the bottom of the water depths, but on the ruins of the past, a new civilization has emerged, breathing in itself the spirit of great change and competition.<br><br>An exciting competition awaits you to claim the title of the best speedrunner, with many challenges scattered across the open world, each with its own leaderboard.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Immerse yourself in a colorful, open world and explore it freely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660810/extras/dd41f84aa203294cd3430572427f5d38.poster.avif?t=1765011590\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660810/extras/dd41f84aa203294cd3430572427f5d38.webm?t=1765011590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660810/extras/dd41f84aa203294cd3430572427f5d38.mp4?t=1765011590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Complete challenge as quickly as possible. In this game, time is of the essence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660810/extras/bcecfbd7fd89e789edfa65a582ff2018.poster.avif?t=1765011590\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660810/extras/bcecfbd7fd89e789edfa65a582ff2018.webm?t=1765011590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660810/extras/bcecfbd7fd89e789edfa65a582ff2018.mp4?t=1765011590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Pla